crew）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260423/1124053069680611328508671.jpeg/b8rGi-6MpR3Vp1ljdfhbFaoZgaFg6qh3-5pFA_uaRQM\" alt=\"啦啦隊LuxyGirl（IG@luxygirlcrew）\"><figcaption>啦啦隊LuxyGirl（IG@luxygirlcrew）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260423/1124053078560346112213840.jpeg/jjLFSNnIt6ARsfR91oD25OI9TcfAUaVhlHZotJR2aLQ\" alt=\"啦啦隊LuxyGirl（IG@luxygirlcrew）\"><figcaption>啦啦隊LuxyGirl（IG@luxygirlcrew）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260423/1124053067797368832073682.jpeg/rTj-KQPMIMMaHRnO7YJ6iSL8pJ6kRrbqE4wI0BOMCNA\" alt=\"啦啦隊LuxyGirl（IG@luxygirlcrew）\"><figcaption>啦啦隊LuxyGirl（IG@luxygirlcrew）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>曾登台灣《紅白》！Kep1er徐永恩休養8個月宣布退團　續約奇蹟留遺憾</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T15:45:27.939860+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1605,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}